          "items": [
            "BRAND NEW LISTING! Come create a Legacy with your family and friends at Legasea Lagoon. Minutes from Alys, Rosemary and Seaside. Walkable to the Big Chill and a short bike/golf cart ride away from the shore. Located in the Prominence Community with access to two resort-style pools which are seasonally heated. Bikes and Golf Cart included (with signed waiver and $30 Incidental Fee Paid to 3rd Party Golf Cart Company). Built-In Bunk Room and Game Room to create all the memories. Be the FIRST to create your Legacy here!!",
            "Our prices include all fees. No hidden fees."
